{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfaf9; --muted:#7a6f64; --accent:#6b8a6f; --card:#fff; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --ink:#2b2b2b; --cta:#9aae85;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf8f6 0%,#fffefc 100%);color:var(--ink)}
    body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
    header{width:100%;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.4));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .nav{max-width:1150px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#8fb98b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    .primary{background:var(--cta);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    main{max-width:1150px;width:100%;padding:36px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}
    .hero-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(41,39,40,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:16px}
    .testimonial{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.95),var(--glass));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;min-height:120px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted)}
    .person{margin-top:12px;font-weight:700}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px}
    .badge{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);font-size:13px;position:relative}
    .badge[data-tooltip]{cursor:help}
    .badge[data-tooltip]:hover::after{content:attr(data-tooltip);position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-8px);top:-34px;background:#222;color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}

    /* Aroma Wheel */
    .wheel-wrap{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .wheel{width:420px;height:420px}
    .notes-legend{flex:1;padding:10px}
    .ring-title{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
    .note{display:inline-block;background:rgba(150,150,150,0.06);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin:6px 6px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .desc-box{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),#fff);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);min-height:72px}

    /* Contact form */
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}
    form{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}
    fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08)}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    .faq{margin-top:22px}
    .faq h3{margin:8px 0}
    .faq-item{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px}

    footer{width:100%;padding:22px 0;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}

    @media(max-width:980px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .wheel{width:320px;height:320px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Potions</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a class="primary" href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <h1>Let's craft a fragrant plan that suits your day</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out to schedule a discovery, ask about blends, or request a scent kit. Our approach is gentle, safety-forward, and designed to fit your routines — scent that may support what you want for the day.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <div class="muted">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px" class="proof">
          <div class="testimonial" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="quote" id="testimonial-text">"A tiny ritual that changed how I begin my mornings — lovely guidance and simple steps."</div>
            <div class="person" id="testimonial-person">— Morgan, local client</div>
            <div class="badges">
              <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Licensed practitioner training and apprenticeship">Practitioner Trained</div>
              <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Transparent sourcing and COA guidance">Sourcing Transparency</div>
              <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Client feedback collected after sessions">Client Feedback</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="width:220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
            <div style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fafafa);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;">Book a complimentary 15-minute chat to see if we’re a fit.</div>
            <div style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fafafa);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;">We prioritize safety notes for pregnancy, pets, and medications.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick Contact</h3>
          <div class="muted">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class="muted">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a href="book.html" class="primary">Reserve a chat</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Proof Gallery</h4>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Rotating client notes and credentials — hover badges to see context.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Featured in local wellness events">Local Stage</div>
            <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Collaborations with herbalists and holistic practitioners">Collaborative</div>
            <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Ethical sourcing verifications available">Ethical Sourcing</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:10px">Aroma wheel — explore notes</h2>
      <div class="wheel-wrap">
        <svg class="wheel" viewBox="0 0 420 420" id="aroma-wheel" aria-labelledby="wheelTitle" role="img">
          <title id="wheelTitle">Aroma wheel with top, middle, and base notes</title>
          <defs>
            <radialGradient id="g1" cx="50%" cy="50%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fff"/>
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f3f7f2"/>
            </radialGradient>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="210" cy="210" r="200" fill="url(#g1)" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.03)"/>
          <g id="top-notes" transform="translate(210,210)"></g>
          <g id="middle-notes" transform="translate(210,210)"></g>
          <g id="base-notes" transform="translate(210,210)"></g>
          <circle cx="210" cy="210" r="56" fill="#fff" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.02)"/>
          <text x="210" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" font-size="14" fill="#333">Aroma Wheel</text>
        </svg>

        <div class="notes-legend">
          <div>
            <div class="ring-title">Top notes — first impressions</div>
            <div id="top-list"></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="ring-title">Middle notes — the heart</div>
            <div id="middle-list"></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="ring-title">Base notes — lasting anchors</div>
            <div id="base-list"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="desc-box" id="note-desc">Hover any note on the wheel to see a short, safety-forward description.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-grid">
      <form id="contact-form" autocomplete="off">
        <h3>Send a message</h3>
        <fieldset>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required />
          <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" placeholder="How can I help?" required></textarea>
          <div class="muted">Safety note: I use safe dilution guidance and recommend patch tests. If you are pregnant or have complex medical conditions, please mention this in your message.</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px">
            <button type="submit">Send message</button>
            <button type="button" id="book-btn" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);color:var(--ink)">Schedule a call</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </form>

      <aside>
        <div style="background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Visit & availability</h4>
          <div class="muted">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Virtual and in-person sessions available by appointment.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Phone</strong>: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div><strong>Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick FAQ</h4>
          <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-item">
              <strong>Dilution and safety</strong>
              <div class="muted">All blends include dilution guidance. You will receive clear percentages and instructions; follow a patch test for topical use.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
              <strong>Patch test</strong>
              <div class="muted">Apply a small diluted amount to inner forearm and wait 24 hours to check for sensitivity.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
              <strong>Pets & pregnancy</strong>
              <div class="muted">If you have pets or are pregnant, disclose this early. Some essential oils are not advised around animals or during pregnancy — I will suggest alternatives.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
              <strong>No medical claims</strong>
              <div class="muted">Sessions are educational and supportive; language will be framed as what scents "may support." Not a substitute for medical advice.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — All rights reserved.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // set year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Simple rotating testimonials
    (function(){
      const testimonials = [
        {text:'"Thoughtful listening and a blend that actually fits my kitchen table life."',person:'— Jamie'},
        {text:'"The session was calm, practical, and gave me a morning ritual I could keep."',person:'— Priya'},
        {text:'"Clear notes about pets and dilution made me comfortable to try a small kit."',person:'— Alex'}
      ];
      let i = 0;
      const tText = document.getElementById('testimonial-text');
      const tPerson = document.getElementById('testimonial-person');
      function show(){
        tText.textContent = testimonials[i].text;
        tPerson.textContent = testimonials[i].person;
        i = (i+1) % testimonials.length;
      }
      setInterval(show,5000);
      // start
      show();
    })();

    // Aroma wheel data and rendering
    (function(){
      const wheel = document.getElementById('aroma-wheel');
      const topNotes = [
        {name:'Bergamot',desc:'Bright, citrus top; often uplifting. Use low dilution on skin and avoid direct sun after topical use.'},
        {name:'Grapefruit',desc:'Fresh citrus that may add clarity; phototoxic in high concentrations—use caution.'},
        {name:'Lemon',desc:'Clean, zesty; suitable for diffusing and careful dilution for topical blends.'}
      ];
      const middleNotes = [
        {name:'Lavender',desc:'Floral-herbaceous, commonly used; generally gentle but always patch test.'},
        {name:'Rosemary',desc:'Herbaceous and clear; can be stimulating—avoid with certain medications; mention if on meds.'},
        {name:'Geranium',desc:'Green-floral heart note; supports balancing blends in small safe dilutions.'}
      ];
      const baseNotes = [
        {name:'Cedarwood',desc:'Warm, grounding base; good for longer-lasting blends, use sparingly around pets.'},
        {name:'Patchouli',desc:'Earthy and anchoring; long-lasting and often blended in small amounts.'},
        {name:'Vanilla CO2',desc:'Soft, gourmand base; typically used in low amounts to round a blend.'}
      ];

      const rings = [ {id:'top-notes',data:topNotes,radius:140,fontSize:12}, {id:'middle-notes',data:middleNotes,radius:96,fontSize:13}, {id:'base-notes',data:baseNotes,radius:56,fontSize:12} ];

      const centerX = 0, centerY = 0;

      function placeNotes(){
        rings.forEach(r => {
          const g = document.getElementById(r.id);
          g.innerHTML = '';
          const step = (Math.PI*2) / r.data.length;
          r.data.forEach((note,idx)=>{
            const angle = -Math.PI/2 + idx*step;
            const x = Math.cos(angle) * r.radius;
            const y = Math.sin(angle) * r.radius;
            const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','text');
            text.setAttribute('x', x);
            text.setAttribute('y', y + 4);
            text.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');
            text.setAttribute('font-size', r.fontSize);
            text.setAttribute('fill','#4a4a4a');
            text.setAttribute('data-desc', note.desc);
            text.setAttribute('tabindex','0');
            text.classList.add('wheel-note');
            text.textContent = note.name;
            // pointer interactions
            text.addEventListener('mouseenter', showDesc);
            text.addEventListener('focus', showDesc);
            text.addEventListener('mouseleave', clearDesc);
            text.addEventListener('blur', clearDesc);
            g.appendChild(text);

            // also add to legend lists
            const listId = r.id.replace('-notes','') + '-list';
            const listEl = document.getElementById(listId);
            const chip = document.createElement('span');
            chip.className = 'note';
            chip.textContent = note.name;
            chip.setAttribute('data-desc', note.desc);
            chip.addEventListener('mouseenter', showDescFromEl);
            chip.addEventListener('focus', showDescFromEl);
            chip.addEventListener('mouseleave', clearDesc);
            listEl.appendChild(chip);
          })
        });
      }

      function showDesc(e){
        const d = e.target.getAttribute('data-desc') || '';
        document.getElementById('note-desc').textContent = d;
      }
      function showDescFromEl(e){
        showDesc(e);
      }
      function clearDesc(){
        document.getElementById('note-desc').textContent = 'Hover any note on the wheel to see a short, safety-forward description.';
      }

      placeNotes();
    })();

    // contact form behavior (no backend here)
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'there';
        form.innerHTML = '<div style="padding:18px"><strong>Thanks, '+escapeHtml(name)+'.</strong> Your message was received locally in the browser. Replace this with a real submission endpoint to collect messages.</div>';
      });
      document.getElementById('book-btn').addEventListener('click', function(){
        window.location.href = 'book.html';
      });
      function escapeHtml(s){ return s.replace(/[&<>\"']/g, function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',"'":"&#39;"}[c]}); }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and developer notes for chunk 4

Files included:
- contact.html  — full contact page with interactive aroma wheel, rotating testimonial "Proof Gallery", contact form, and FAQ.

Placeholders to replace in any environment:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

How to test locally:
1. Drop this file into the project root (or the page folder) together with other site pages (index.html, services.html, etc.).
2. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists in the project (this chunk references that path for background styling in the site theme). The SVG pattern file is created in another chunk — if you are testing standalone, create a simple SVG at that path or remove the reference.
3. Open contact.html in a modern browser. The page is static and the JS runs locally — no server is required for the interactive behaviors.

Interactive features implemented here:
- Aroma wheel: an SVG-based ring layout with top / middle / base notes. Hover any note (in the wheel or the legend) to show a concise, safety-forward description in the description box.
- Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials every 5 seconds in the hero proof area and includes credibility badges with hover tooltips using data-tooltip attributes.

Safety and content notes:
- All language is intentionally safety-forward and does not include medical claims. Terms like "may support" are used in guidance and FAQ.
- The FAQ includes dilution guidance, patch test instructions, pet and pregnancy notes, and a reminder that sessions are not medical treatment.

Developer tips:
- The contact form is a frontend placeholder: it prevents default submit and shows a local confirmation. Wire to your server endpoint or form service by replacing the submit handler.
- The aroma wheel is rendered from JS arrays inside contact.html. To add or change notes, edit the topNotes/middleNotes/baseNotes arrays in that file.
- Test accessibility: note elements are focusable and will show descriptions on keyboard focus.

Styling:
- All styles are inline in contact.html for portability. Adjust CSS variables at the top of the style block to match your palette.

If you need this page adapted to a different layout family or split into components, tell me which pieces you'd like modularized (SVG component, testimonials module, form handler) and I will produce chunked files accordingly."}
BUNDLE_END
